{
  "note": "Which installed font the motion layer uses for each role. Each role is a list tried in order: a file name (looked up in the folders for this OS) or {\"file\", \"variation\", \"index\"} for a variable font or a font collection. An absolute path works too. When nothing is found, Pillow's built-in font is used. Your own lines go in motion_fonts.json in the Proofhouse home folder and are tried first.",
  "folders": {
    "windows": ["%WINDIR%/Fonts", "%LOCALAPPDATA%/Microsoft/Windows/Fonts"],
    "darwin": ["/System/Library/Fonts", "/Library/Fonts", "~/Library/Fonts"],
    "linux": ["/usr/share/fonts", "/usr/local/share/fonts", "~/.local/share/fonts", "~/.fonts"]
  },
